ISO-10303-21;
/* N005: seam edge on CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE: 3D LINE +Z sense but pcurve in -V direction (inverted); pcurve and 3D curve parameterisations opposite; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET — OCC yields empty */
